00:10:34,495 --> 00:10:45,543
[SPEAKER_03]: Hi, good evening.

112
00:10:45,583 --> 00:10:47,584
[SPEAKER_10]: This is Shirin Everett from KP Law.

113
00:10:48,585 --> 00:10:55,049
[SPEAKER_10]: Yes, the Affordable Housing Trust is subject to procurement, so it's subject to the requirements of 30B.

114
00:10:56,542 --> 00:11:05,325
[SPEAKER_10]: However, transactions between cities, you know, intra-city and inter-city and town transactions are exempt from 30B.

115
00:11:05,965 --> 00:11:19,990
[SPEAKER_10]: And that's what's stated in the ordinance, which is, it's a board of the city and therefore subject to 30B, but of course, agreements and conveyances between departments is exempt from those requirements.

