202
00:19:41,837 --> 00:19:52,921
[SPEAKER_10]: So this statute, which is chapter 40, section 55C, provides that trustees are appointed by the mayor, subject to confirmation by the city council.

203
00:19:53,818 --> 00:19:55,399
[SPEAKER_10]: So that's the general rule.

204
00:19:56,299 --> 00:20:12,467
[SPEAKER_10]: However, the city charter provides that among one of the things that can happen, the city charter provides that the mayor's appointments to city boards does not have to be ratified by the city council.

