691
01:09:37,431 --> 01:09:42,472
[SPEAKER_00]: Affordable housing is definitely a major, major issue, in my opinion.

692
01:09:43,525 --> 01:09:50,490
[SPEAKER_00]: And as a matter of fact, buying heat and oil and groceries has been a problem in the last year and a half also.

693
01:09:51,610 --> 01:10:00,536
[SPEAKER_00]: And I doubt the city of Medford has many parcels to speak of that's for sale unless you start knocking down high schools and elementary schools.

694
01:10:01,296 --> 01:10:04,138
[SPEAKER_00]: I doubt there's any land of substance available.

695
01:10:05,239 --> 01:10:09,241
[SPEAKER_00]: So I've been thinking out of the box, been patiently listening.

696
01:10:10,602 --> 01:10:12,043
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm thinking more like,

697
01:10:13,056 --> 01:10:33,242
[SPEAKER_00]: My idea would be by eminent domain, let's say, take an example, 20,000 square feet of Mystic Avenue and go six stories high and sell it as a cooperative housing shares as they do in the Big Apple, New York City.

698
01:10:34,163 --> 01:10:42,045
[SPEAKER_00]: I believe from my real estate experience, that keeps the housing prices low in perpetuity, period.

699
01:10:45,919 --> 01:10:46,899
[SPEAKER_03]: Thank you, Mr. Casagnetti.

